12	 *  created, its date then plus the terms of its person's grade on that date, else the sheet's terms), and
13	 *  whether its last statement bound it to n/a (the rate that would apply to it had ended: its due then
14	 *  stays n/a, not live). */
15	public record Claim(long id, long personId, String amount, String date, String note, String status,
16	        String number, String due, String openedBy, boolean stated, String statedDue, String corrects,
17	        String dueBy, boolean statedNa) {
18	
